msgstr "she does not say it unkindly. she goes back to the racks."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2383
msgid "she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk."
msgstr "she does not say thank you. she does not say anything at all for the first hour of the walk."

