msgid "she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was."
msgstr "she goes very still when you describe him. says she knows exactly who that is, and what he signed, and that neither of those is the part that matters to her. says he was one of the two who stood up when the sentence was read. she does not say who the other one was."

